 I finished with around 8 million points. (Still not enough for the top
score on the system I play on nyx. <sigh>)

  I never messed with polypiling or had a ring of conflict, the
only advantage I took being with a cursed bell of opening.

  I of course now can't play a Samurai again as this game has an evil
intelligence and is just waiting to punish me ...

